WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.020
Speaker 1: Let's just get right into things
today, because there is so much to cover,

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:08.380
one of the things I mentioned in my Monday
segment about the current Israeli-Palestinian

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:14.080
flare up is that not only does Hamas benefit
from what's going on because they justify

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:19.900
their existence by being on the receiving
end of Israeli rockets.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:26.720
But Benjamin Netanyahu justifies his position
as prime minister, as Mr. Security, when there

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:32.460
are at this point, I believe it's 3500 Hamas
rockets that have been shot in the direction

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:33.460
of Israel.

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:40.490
And I even mentioned Benjamin Netanyahu likely
realizes that unless something changes, his

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:43.770
days as prime minister are numbered, unable
to form a government.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:48.650
Recently, he was recently interviewed on CBS
Face the Nation by John Dickerson.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:55.320
And Dickerson, to his credit, went right at
this idea and said essentially, are you killing

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.420
people to try to stay in power?

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.240
That's the crux of it.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:00.240
Let's look at the exchange.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:02.149
Speaker 2: Let me get
Speaker 3: before you know, neither Arabs

00:01:02.149 --> 00:01:05.380
killing is is used for Jews killing Arabs,
Arabs and

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:06.550
Speaker 4: Jews.

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:10.270
Let me ask I want you to respond to one other
thing before we go, which is your domestic

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:11.270
challenges.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:14.450
You are under investigation for bribery, fraud,
breach of trust.

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:18.280
You've also had some difficulty for failed
attempts to put together a government in the

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:19.860
last twenty three months.

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:24.200
This leads to the criticism that your current
actions are basically an effort to stay in

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:25.200
power.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.290
And what's your response to that?

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:31.080
Speaker 3: That's preposterous.

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:37.890
You know, when I was a young soldier, 18 years
old, I heard a fellow soldier who died in

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:38.890
my arms.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:45.660
A few years later, my brother, my older brother,
died while leading a rescue mission in Entebbe,

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.220
Uganda, to release Israeli hostages.

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:49.390
I've seen combatants fall.

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:51.670
I've seen my brother fall.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:57.480
And I think anybody who knows me knows that
I've never, ever subordinated security concerns,

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:01.450
the life of our soldiers, the life of our
citizens for political interests.

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:02.450
That's just hogwash.

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:08.500
I'll do what I have to do to protect the lives
of Israeli citizens and to restore peace and

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.640
made peace with four Arab countries.

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:16.580
I'm glad that we have a restoration of some
considerable calm within Israel.

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:22.090
That's my goal, to restore peace and quiet
and to assure tranquility and reconciliation

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:23.090
for all.

00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:25.420
Speaker 4: But this is a persistent criticism,
Mr. Prime Minister.

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:26.920
Why do you think it persists?

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:34.310
Speaker 3: It persists because I've been reelected
five times, it persists because I beat every

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:39.750
other candidate in the public polls and in
direct election simulations, apparently the

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:43.520
people of Israel, the majority, don't agree
with his false criticism.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:48.050
The cynicism, they know that I'm standing
there for Israel and I'm doing everything

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:52.240
I can for the safety and prosperity of the
Israeli people.

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:55.080
By the way, all of Israel's citizens, Jews
and Arabs alike.

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:57.480
Speaker 4: All right, Mr. Prime Minister,
we're out of time.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:01.000
Speaker 1: This is not idle speculation.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:07.980
The Associated Press reports that, quote,
Just over a week ago, the long time Israeli

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:11.540
leaders political career seemed all but over.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:16.330
He had failed to form a coalition government
following an indecisive parliamentary election,

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:21.050
and his political rivals were on the cusp
of pushing him out of office.

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:29.080
Now, as Israel and Gaza Hamas rulers wage
their fourth war in just over a decade, Netanyahu's

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:31.530
fortunes have changed dramatically.

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:34.550
His rival's prospects have crumbled.

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:39.000
Netanyahu is back in his comfortable role
as Mr. Security, and the country could soon

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:44.190
be headed for yet another election campaign
that would guarantee him at least several

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:46.460
more months in office.

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:52.840
Rightly, this is making many people ask, was
this another one of these disgusting, cynical

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:55.880
moves that we've come to expect from Benjamin
Netanyahu?

00:03:55.880 --> 00:04:00.670
We saw this before during the lead up to an
election in Israel.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:06.800
And exactly as I suggested, I suspected on
Monday, more people are now asking this exact

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.060
same question.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:11.790
And there's every indication that this is
exactly what is going on.

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:13.340
Will it work?

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:16.670
I wish I could say no, but sadly it might.

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:21.299
And of course, the longer Netanyahu remains
in power as well as the longer Hamas remains

00:04:21.299 --> 00:05:31.820
in power, the prospects of a real peace deal
are essentially zero, as I outlined earlier

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:34.440
this week.

